": "", "findings": null, "impression": "1. 窦性心动过缓：无症状的窦性心动过缓通常无需治疗。但如心率显著减慢，出现心排血量不足症状，可用药物治疗，严重者考虑心脏起搏器治疗，正规医院专科诊治。2. 甲状腺囊肿（多发）：建议专科治疗。3. 中性粒细胞百分数降低：粒细胞异常减少，建议及时复查，如果仍然异常，请尽早去医院，查明原因。4. 淋巴细胞百分数增高：淋巴细胞异常，建议复查，如果仍然异常，请尽早去医院，查明原因。5. 血小板压积增高：血小板压积异常，建议复查，如果仍然异常，请去医院，查明原因。6. 血小板计数增高：血小板计数异常，建议及时复查，如果仍然异常，请尽早去医院，查明原因。", "source": 1, "status": 1, "extra": null, "created_at": "2026-04-12T15:37:32.964349Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-12T15:37:32.964358Z", "attachments": []}, {"id": 55, "user": 1, "member": 16, "medical_record": null, "category": "laboratory", "sub_category": "", "item_name": "医疗报告", "performed_at": null, "reported_at": null, "organization_name": "苏州大学附属第四医院、苏州市独墅湖医院", "department_name": "", "doctor_name": "朱孝明、魏和轩、王一發、魏雨轩、王一斐", "findings": "", "impression": "", "source": 2, "status": 1, "extra": {"source": "typed_upload"}, "created_at": "2026-04-12T15:15:37.241891Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-12T15:15:37.241910Z", "attachments": [{"id": 162, "file_uuid": "d8d80804-a19b-4785-a626-cdb939d1b032", "original_name": "photo_57E71F21-49AE-4317-9FAB-84793C43461C.jpg", "file_size": 290933, "mime_type": "image/jpeg", "file_md5": "b4647564d696c15d55ede32341c30b54", "business_type": "examination_report", "business_id": "55", "object_key": "SparkClient/20260412/D8D80804-A19B-4785-A626-CDB939D1B032/photo_57E71F21-49AE-4317-9FAB-84793C43461C.jpg", "storage_type": "oss", "created_at": "2026-04-12T15:13:49.821305Z", "file_url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260412/D8D80804-A19B-4785-A626-CDB939D1B032/photo_57E71F21-49AE-4317-9FAB-84793C43461C.jpg"}, {"id": 161, "file_uuid": "0168ae71-8153-438b-95e0-ef6ce2a27c67", "original_name": "photo_E23597CE-81A7-4742-A5CC-6092E1897B18.jpg", "file_size": 273201, "mime_type": "image/jpeg", "file_md5": "b549c88052b52d02e02867117b763749", "business_type": "examination_report", "business_id": "55", "object_key": "SparkClient/20260412/0168AE71-8153-438B-95E0-EF6CE2A27C67/photo_E23597CE-81A7-4742-A5CC-6092E1897B18.jpg