", "result_value": "甲状腺形态大小正常，甲状腺双叶内均可见多个类圆形无回声区,最大位于右叶，大小约2mm×3mm，后方回声增强，内部未见血流", "unit": "", "reference_range": "", "flag": "", "result_at": "2023-01-07T23:59:12Z", "modality": "彩超", "body_part": "甲状腺", "diagnosis": "甲状腺双叶囊肿（多发）", "extra": {}, "sort_order": 50, "created_at": "2026-04-13T02:55:53.586202Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-13T02:55:53.586211Z"}, {"id": 1342, "business_type": "health_exam_report", "business_id": 10, "member": 16, "category": "前列腺彩超", "sub_category": "泌尿系统彩超", "item_name": "前列腺", "item_code": "", "result_value": "前列腺大小、形态正常，包膜光滑完整，两侧对称，内部回声均匀", "unit": "", "reference_range": "", "flag": "", "result_at": "2023-01-07T23:59:12Z", "modality": "彩超", "body_part": "前列腺", "diagnosis": "", "extra": {}, "sort_order": 51, "created_at": "2026-04-13T02:55:53.589286Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-13T02:55:53.589294Z"}, {"id": 1343, "business_type": "health_exam_report", "business_id": 10, "member": 16, "category": "胸部CT", "sub_category": "影像学检查", "item_name": "胸部CT平扫", "item_code": "", "result_value": "两侧胸廓对称。肺窗示两肺纹理清晰，走行自然，未见明显异常密度影。两侧肺门不大。纵隔窗示心影及大血管形态正常，纵隔内未见肿块及明显肿大淋巴结。无胸腔积液及胸膜增厚", "unit": "", "reference_range": "", "flag": "", "result_at": "2023-01-07T23:59:12Z", "modality": "CT", "body_part": "胸部", "diagnosis": "", "extra": {}, "sort_order": 52, "created_at": "2026-04-13T02:55:53.593044Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-13T02:55:53.593051Z"}, {"id": 1344, "business_type": "health_exam_report", "business_id": 10, "member": 16, "category": "癌胚抗原检测定量", "sub_category": "肿瘤标志物", "item_name": "癌胚抗原测定定量(CEA)", "item_code": "", "result_value": "0.896", "unit": "ng/mL", "reference_range": "0-5", "flag": "", "result_at": "2023-01-07T23:59:12Z", "modality": "实验室检查", "body_part": "全身", "diagnosis": "", "extra": {}, "sort_order": 53, "created_at": "2026-04-13T02:55:53.595583Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-13T02:55:53.595592Z"}, {"id": 1345, "business_type": "health_exam_report", "business_id": 10, "member": 16, "category": "甲胎蛋白检测定量", "sub_category": "肿瘤标志物", "item_name": "甲胎蛋白测定定量(AF